{"tool_name":"robust_web","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"robust_web","home":"https://robust-web.net","license":"GPL-3.0","summary":"Online bias-aware disease module mining with ROBUST-Web.","addition_date":"2024-01-03T15:43:50.086376Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T14:23:52.645443Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:robust_web","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"david.b.blumenthal@fau.de","name":"David B Blumenthal","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8651-750X","typeEntity":"Person"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Differential gene expression profiling","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3223"},{"term":"Gene-set enrichment analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2436"},{"term":"Visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0337"}]}],"name":"ROBUST-Web","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Pub2Tools","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/bioinformatics/btad345","metadata":{"abstract":"Summary: We present ROBUST-Web which implements our recently presented ROBUST disease module mining algorithm in a user-friendly web application. ROBUST-Web features seamless downstream disease module exploration via integrated gene set enrichment analysis, tissue expression annotation, and visualization of drug-protein and disease-gene links. Moreover, ROBUST-Web includes bias-aware edge costs for the underlying Steiner tree model as a new algorithmic feature, which allow to correct for study bias in protein-protein interaction networks and further improves the robustness of the computed modules.","authors":[{"name":"Abdrabbou M.M."},{"name":"Baumbach J."},{"name":"Blumenthal D.B."},{"name":"List M."},{"name":"Lucchetta M."},{"name":"Maier A."},{"name":"Sarkar S."},{"name":"Schaefer M.H."}],"date":"2023-06-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Bioinformatics","title":"Online bias-aware disease module min